{"text": "Al oír sus voces, Ricitos despertó. Los osos mantuvieron la distancia para no asustarla. La niña contó lo que había hecho y pidió perdón. Explicó que su tía la estaría buscando cerca del sendero. Ricitos: Entré sin permiso y dañé tu silla. Lo siento.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.374916, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.389666, "end": 0.685041, "from": 3, "to": 6}, {"start": 0.699791, "end": 0.965624, "from": 7, "to": 10}, {"start": 0.980416, "end": 1.467791, "from": 11, "to": 16}, {"start": 1.763125, "end": 2.398166, "from": 18, "to": 25}, {"start": 2.412958, "end": 3.151374, "from": 26, "to": 34}, {"start": 4.19425, "end": 4.445333, "from": 36, "to": 39}, {"start": 4.460083, "end": 4.784999, "from": 40, "to": 44}, {"start": 4.79975, "end": 5.449541, "from": 45, "to": 56}, {"start": 5.464333, "end": 5.538166, "from": 57, "to": 59}, {"start": 5.552916, "end": 6.232249, "from": 60, "to": 69}, {"start": 6.247041, "end": 6.498124, "from": 70, "to": 74}, {"start": 6.512875, "end": 6.704875, "from": 75, "to": 77}, {"start": 6.719625, "end": 7.502333, "from": 78, "to": 87}, {"start": 8.521375, "end": 8.728125, "from": 89, "to": 91}, {"start": 8.742916, "end": 9.112124, "from": 92, "to": 96}, {"start": 9.126875, "end": 9.555166, "from": 97, "to": 102}, {"start": 9.569958, "end": 9.717624, "from": 103, "to": 105}, {"start": 9.732375, "end": 9.865291, "from": 106, "to": 109}, {"start": 9.880083, "end": 10.293583, "from": 110, "to": 115}, {"start": 10.308375, "end": 10.60375, "from": 116, "to": 121}, {"start": 10.6185, "end": 10.692333, "from": 122, "to": 123}, {"start": 10.707125, "end": 11.105875, "from": 124, "to": 129}, {"start": 11.120625, "end": 11.696583, "from": 130, "to": 136}, {"start": 12.715625, "end": 13.365416, "from": 138, "to": 145}, {"start": 13.380208, "end": 13.498374, "from": 146, "to": 149}, {"start": 13.513125, "end": 13.705125, "from": 150, "to": 152}, {"start": 13.719875, "end": 13.985708, "from": 153, "to": 156}, {"start": 14.0004